        "id": 80452,
        "name": "Pac-Man Collection",
        "summary": "Pac-Man Collection (Atari 7800) is a 2006 homebrew compilation by Bob “PacManPlus” DeCrescenzo, published through AtariAge. It includes multiple Pac-Man and Ms. Pac-Man arcade variants—such as Puck Man, Hangly Man, Ultra Pac-Man, and Random Mazes—each can also be played in Plus mode, with selectable Fast, Slow, or Button-activated speed settings.\n\nIt includes these games:\nPac-Man\nPuck Man\nHangly Man\nUltra Pac-Man\n\nRandom Mazes (Pac-Man style)\nMs. Pac-Man\nMs. Pac-Attack\nMs. Random Mazes",
